[0.284, "o", "Hotspots — 3 months churn window\r\n\r\n🧬 COMPLEXITY × 🔄 CHURN — Total score: 4,234\r\n\u001b[33mConfidence: WEAK — 4 files with measurable complexity (WEAK sample size).\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[2mcomplexity × churn. Complex code that changes often poses maintenance risk.\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2mMetric concept: McCabe cyclomatic complexity (1976) via scc · Strength: objective, language-agnostic · Limit: parsers and state machines score high naturally\u001b[22m\r\nTiers: \u001b[31m0 HOT\u001b[39m, \u001b[33m1 WARM\u001b[39m, \u001b[34m3 COOL\u001b[39m\r\nShowing: 4 of 4\r\n\r\nFile                                                 Score      %  Churn  Cmplx   Dens        Tier\r\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n\u001b[33msrc/analyze.ts                                       3,151   74.4     23    137   0.16     \u001b[33m☀️ WARM\u001b"]
